The list of disposable domains in data/disposable-domains.php is generated from
disposable_email_blocklist.conf of
https://github.com/disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains, dedicated
to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal (data/LICENSE). The release
imported is in data/VERSION. The domains were checked, written in their ASCII
form, without duplicates and sorted.

The list of top-level domains in data/top-level-domains.php is generated from
https://data.iana.org/TLD/tlds-alpha-by-domain.txt, the list of the domains of
the DNS root zone published by the Internet Assigned Numbers Authority (IANA).
The release imported, the "# Version" of the list, is in data/VERSION. The
domains were checked, written in lowercase, without duplicates and sorted.
